            "text": "<p>We started Moon while converting our van and couldn’t find an awning we liked. That project turned into a company, and the best product ideas still come from testing gear with our friends out in the wild.<br/><br/>We’re proud to say Moon Surface is made with that same spirit. It’s built by our Amish partners in Indiana, who share our care for quality, simplicity, and things that last.<br/></p>"
